From 009bc58a1776a668f7c90acf5334a63c770f62c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Opaniuk <igor.opaniuk@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:00:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] gen_contents: drop the contents.xml.in template input

Every platform carries its contents metadata in YAML and no template
is left in the tree, so remove the -t/-p template path. gen_contents
now only takes a platform or board file.

The tests pin the generated contents.xml with an expected file,
produced byte-identical to the old template output, instead of
filling a template at test time.

Signed-off-by: Igor Opaniuk <igor.opaniuk@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 qcom_ptool/contents_yaml.py           |  25 ++-
 qcom_ptool/gen_contents.py            |  69 +++------
 tests/unit/data/contents-expected.xml |  92 +++++++++++
 tests/unit/test_contents_yaml.py      | 212 ++------------------------
 4 files changed, 139 insertions(+), 259 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/unit/data/contents-expected.xml

